Schoultz</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effects of oral contraceptives on breast epithelial proliferation</article-title><source>Breast Cancer Res Treat</source><year>2001</year><volume>65</volume><fpage>163</fpage><lpage>169</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Breast Cancer Res Treat||65|163||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11261832</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jeng</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Parker</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Jordan</surname><given-names>VC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Estrogenic potential of progestins in oral contraceptives to stimulate human breast cancer cell proliferation</article-title><source>Cancer Res</source><year>1992</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>6539</fpage><lpage>6546</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Res||52|6539||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1423300</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jick</surname><given-names>SS</given-names></name><name><surname>Walker</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Stergachis</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Jick</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Oral contraceptives and breast cancer</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>1989</year><volume>59</volume><fpage>618</fpage><lpage>621</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||59|618||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2713248</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Madigan</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name><name><surname>Troisi</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Potischman</surname><given-n